# ── Secrets, credentials, temp files (NEVER commit) ──────────────────────────
# Catch the patterns we used during Razorpay live-mode migration and any
# similar defensive holding files. Service account JSONs MUST never land here.
*.tmp
*.tmp.txt
creds.*
.secret_*
*.credentials.json
*.serviceaccount.json
firebase-adminsdk-*.json
service-account-*.json
gcloud-service-key.json

# ── Worktrees & local Claude state ───────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/worktrees/
.gemini/
